sequenceDiagram
 participant F as Frontend
 participant G as Gateway
 participant P as Controller
 participant C as CreateOrder
 participant R as Repository
 participant D as MySQL
 Note over F,G: POST /api/payments/orders
 F->>G: Crear orden
